Signed-off-by: David S. Miller <davem@davemloft.net>

Here is the root cause:
The bug arises from improper handling of device unregistration when the function `dev_change_net_namespace` fails after a previous failure in `rtnl_configure_link`. The original code did not ensure that the unregistration process was consistently executed in both failure scenarios, potentially leading to resource leaks or inconsistent states in the network device management.

